---@field labels? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.StringMap Cross-service attributes for the location. For example {"cloud.googleapis.com/region": "us-east1"}
---@field metadata? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.DocumentMap Service-specific metadata. For example the available capacity at the given location.
---@field displayName? string The friendly name for this location, typically a nearby city name. For example, "Tokyo".
---@field locationId? string The canonical id for this location. For example: `"us-east1"`.
