---@alias gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.LocationList gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.Location[]

---Parameters overriding decisions based on the source machine image configurations.
---@class gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.MachineImageParametersOverrides
---@field machineType? string Optional. The machine type to create the MachineImage with. If empty, the service will choose a relevant machine type based on the information from the source image. For more information about machine types, please refer to https://cloud.google.com/compute/docs/machine-resource.

---The target details of the machine image resource that will be created by the image import job.
---@class gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.MachineImageTargetDetails
---@field serviceAccount? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.ServiceAccount Optional. The service account to assign to the instance created by the machine image.
---@field additionalLicenses? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.StringList Optional. Additional licenses to assign to the instance created by the machine image. Format: https://www.googleapis.com/compute/v1/projects/PROJECT_ID/global/licenses/LICENSE_NAME Or https://www.googleapis.com/compute/beta/projects/PROJECT_ID/global/licenses/LICENSE_NAME
---@field networkInterfaces? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.NetworkInterfaceList Optional. The network interfaces to create with the instance created by the machine image. Internal and external IP addresses, and network tiers are ignored for machine image import.
---@field machineImageName? string Required. The name of the machine image to be created.
---@field encryption? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.Encryption Immutable. The encryption to apply to the machine image. If the Image Import resource has an encryption, this field must be set to the same encryption key.
---@field shieldedInstanceConfig? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.ShieldedInstanceConfig Optional. Shielded instance configuration.
---@field machineImageParametersOverrides? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.MachineImageParametersOverrides Optional. Parameters overriding decisions based on the source machine image configurations.
---@field tags? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.StringList Optional. The tags to apply to the instance created by the machine image.
---@field targetProject? string Required. Reference to the TargetProject resource that represents the target project in which the imported machine image will be created.
---@field osAdaptationParameters? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.ImageImportOsAdaptationParameters Optional. Use to set the parameters relevant for the OS adaptation process.
---@field description? string Optional. An optional description of the machine image.
---@field skipOsAdaptation? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.SkipOsAdaptation Optional. Use to skip OS adaptation process.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.StringMap Optional. The labels to apply to the instance created by the machine image.
---@field singleRegionStorage? boolean Optional. Set to true to set the machine image storageLocations to the single region of the import job. When false, the closest multi-region is selected.

---MigratingVm describes the VM that will be migrated from a Source environment and its replication state.
---@class gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.MigratingVm
---@field currentSyncInfo? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.ReplicationCycle Output only. Details of the current running replication cycle.
---@field sourceVmId? string The unique ID of the VM in the source. The VM's name in vSphere can be changed, so this is not the VM's name but rather its moRef id. This id is of the form vm-.
---@field azureSourceVmDetails? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.AzureSourceVmDetails Output only. Details of the VM from an Azure source.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The last time the migrating VM resource was updated.
---@field cutoverForecast? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.CutoverForecast Output only. Provides details of future CutoverJobs of a MigratingVm. Set to empty when cutover forecast is unavailable.
---@field stateTime? string Output only. The last time the migrating VM state was updated.
---@field displayName? string The display name attached to the MigratingVm by the user.
---@field lastSync? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.ReplicationSync Output only. The most updated snapshot created time in the source that finished replication.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.MigratingVmStateEnum Output only. State of the MigratingVm.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.StringMap The labels of the migrating VM.
---@field error? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.Status Output only. Provides details on the state of the Migrating VM in case of an error in replication.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time the migrating VM was created (this refers to this resource and not to the time it was installed in the source).
---@field group? string Output only. The group this migrating vm is included in, if any. The group is represented by the full path of the appropriate Group resource.
---@field expiration? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.Expiration Output only. Provides details about the expiration state of the migrating VM.
---@field vmwareSourceVmDetails? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.VmwareSourceVmDetails Output only. Details of the VM from a Vmware source.
---@field recentCloneJobs? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.CloneJobList Output only. The recent clone jobs performed on the migrating VM. This field holds the vm's last completed clone job and the vm's running clone job, if one exists. Note: To have this field populated you need to explicitly request it via the "view" parameter of the Get/List request.
---@field lastReplicationCycle? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.ReplicationCycle Output only. Details of the last replication cycle. This will be updated whenever a replication cycle is finished and is not to be confused with last_sync which is only updated on successful replication cycles.
---@field name? string Output only. The identifier of the MigratingVm.
---@field computeEngineVmDefaults? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.TargetVMDetails Details of the VM in Compute Engine. Deprecated: Use compute_engine_target_defaults instead.
---@field computeEngineDisksTargetDefaults? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.ComputeEngineDisksTargetDefaults Details of the target Persistent Disks in Compute Engine.
---@field policy? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.SchedulePolicy The replication schedule policy.
---@field computeEngineTargetDefaults? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.ComputeEngineTargetDefaults Details of the target VM in Compute Engine.
---@field targetDefaults? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.TargetVMDetails The default configuration of the target VM that will be created in Google Cloud as a result of the migration. Deprecated: Use compute_engine_target_defaults instead.
---@field recentCutoverJobs? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.CutoverJobList Output only. The recent cutover jobs performed on the migrating VM. This field holds the vm's last completed cutover job and the vm's running cutover job, if one exists. Note: To have this field populated you need to explicitly request it via the "view" parameter of the Get/List request.
---@field description? string The description attached to the migrating VM by the user.
---@field awsSourceVmDetails? gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.AwsSourceVmDetails Output only. Details of the VM from an AWS source.

---@alias gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.MigratingVmList gcp.unstable.vmmigration_v1alpha1.MigratingVm[]

